<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Club Membership</title>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/navbar') %>
    <h1>Clubhouse Club</h1>
    <h3>Benefits of becoming a member of our Clubhouse Club: </h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Increase in societal status.</li>
        <li>Increased Aura</li>
        <li>Friends(probably)</li>
        <li>Reveal who wrote which post</li>
        <li>Write your own posts</li>
    </ul>
    
    
    <h3>Want to become a member of our club ?</h3>
    <p>To join the club enter the Super Secret club passcode: </p>

    <Form method="post" action="/auth/membership">
        <input type="password" name="passcode" placeholder="Enter passcode">
        <button type="submit">Join</button>
    </Form>
    
</body>
</html>